{"mainQuestId":76044,"title":"The Vanishing Bounty Target","description":"On the bounty board at The Flagship, there's a target known for vanishing without a trace after committing numerous heinous crimes. Yet justice demands retribution, and sins must be atoned for. Asking Leszek, an employee at The Flagship, may yield further information.","titleTextMapHash":2029198087,"descTextMapHash":2177681598,"mainQuestExcel":{"mainQuestId":76044,"titleTextMapHash":2029198087,"title":"The Vanishing Bounty Target","descTextMapHash":2177681598,"description":"On the bounty board at The Flagship, there's a target known for vanishing without a trace after committing numerous heinous crimes. Yet justice demands retribution, and sins must be atoned for. Asking Leszek, an employee at The Flagship, may yield further information.","chapterId":0,"mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ76044","mainQuestRaw":{"activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"chapterId":0,"descTextMapHash":2177681598,"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GMENNHMBBOH":[{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0}],"id":76044,"IELNANBAMLH":"QUEST_PAUSE_RES_DESTROY_CLIENT_ONLY","IGHALKGCHAB":2592205433,"LEFIHLHODBM":[],"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ76044","mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","MHHFFHCLDKI":true,"PEDANLIDLGE":0,"PEFIFLDHPEE":true,"recommendLevel":0,"repeatable":false,"resId":0,"rewardIdList":[176044],"series":0,"showRedPoint":false,"showType":"QUEST_SHOW","specialShowCondIdList":[],"specialShowQuestId":0,"specialShowRewardId":[],"suggestTrackMainQuestList":[],"suggestTrackOutOfOrder":false,"taskID":0,"titleTextMapHash":2029198087,"type":"WQ","unlockDescTextMapHash":2723691614}},"flow":[{"subQuestId":7604401,"order":1,"stepDescription":"Visit the Curatorium of Secrets","stepDescTextMapHash":886203500,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["1316"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1205,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7604401,7604403],"talks":[{"talkId":7604401,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7604401","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7603704","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_STATE_NOT_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7604401,"initDialog":760440101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1316,1317],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76044/Q7604401","priority":5,"questId":76044,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":760440101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2095989578,"text":"There's a particularly tricky bounty at The Flagship with basically no leads.","nextNodeIds":[760440102]},{"nodeId":760440102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2443549530,"text":"The target was attacking people in the north of Lempo Isle, but now he's disappeared without a trace. No one seems to know where he's gone...","nextNodeIds":[760440103]},{"nodeId":760440103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":2258224954,"text":"Every contact leaves a trace. No matter how carefully someone covers their tracks, in doing so, they always create new ones.","nextNodeIds":[760440104]},{"nodeId":760440104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":1357120890,"text":"Besides, just because the bounty didn't include any extra information, doesn't mean whoever posted it doesn't have any.","nextNodeIds":[760440105]},{"nodeId":760440105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":3342072810,"text":"I never thought of that... I'll go ask Leszek — with all my experience, I should be able to get something useful out of him.","nextNodeIds":[760440106]},{"nodeId":760440106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":3239036674,"text":"I'll leave it to you then.","nextNodeIds":[760440107]},{"nodeId":760440107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1063193370,"text":"You can count on me, Boss Nef!","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7604403,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7604401","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7603704","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7604403,"initDialog":760440301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1316,1317],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76044/Q7604403","priority":5,"questId":76044,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":760440301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1674699450,"text":"Hmm... Seems like only yesterday, there were plenty of bounties going at The Flagship — now there's only one left.","nextNodeIds":[760440302]},{"nodeId":760440302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":3951048754,"text":"#Apparently, that's all down to {NICKNAME}. But even {M#he}{F#she} hasn't been able to crack this last one.","nextNodeIds":[760440303]},{"nodeId":760440303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1174347146,"text":"Well, there really aren't any leads—","nextNodeIds":[760440304]},{"nodeId":760440304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":476818666,"text":"Ah, but... Just because something isn't written on the bounty board, doesn't mean it doesn't exist.","nextNodeIds":[760440305]},{"nodeId":760440305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":2793642474,"text":"What's this — a sudden flash of inspiration?","nextNodeIds":[760440306]},{"nodeId":760440306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":3244260538,"text":"I'm going to ask Leszek — with all my experience, I should be able to get something useful out of him.","nextNodeIds":[760440307]},{"nodeId":760440307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1316,"speakerName":"Nefer","textMapHash":378992058,"text":"I'll leave it to you then.","nextNodeIds":[760440308]},{"nodeId":760440308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1951468506,"text":"You can count on me, Boss Nef!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["1316"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1205,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7604402,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Talk to Leszek, \"The Flagship\" employee","stepDescTextMapHash":1493091788,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604402,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["7012"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1204,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7604402],"talks":[{"talkId":7604402,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7604402","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7604402,"initDialog":760440201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[7012],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76044/Q7604402","priority":5,"questId":76044,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":760440201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":820903866,"text":"Details on the targets are up on the board. I can fill you in if needed, but don't bother haggling over the bounties.","nextNodeIds":[760440202]},{"nodeId":760440202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":4231182242,"text":"About the bounty targets...","nextNodeIds":[760440203]},{"nodeId":760440203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":460658106,"text":"There are four targets on the board, but we only have leads for three. The first one's wanted for fraud...","nextNodeIds":[760440204]},{"nodeId":760440204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1271910650,"text":"...Stop, stop, stop! Save me the spiel for the brand new treasure hunters — I could reel it off as well as you. You know who I'm here about.","nextNodeIds":[760440205]},{"nodeId":760440205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":1276573850,"text":"The Curatorium wants to get involved?","nextNodeIds":[760440206]},{"nodeId":760440206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2245282346,"text":"That depends on how the Boss is feeling. Hmm, how did we arrive at you asking questions?","nextNodeIds":[760440207]},{"nodeId":760440207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":384320578,"text":"Anyway, seems to me the real reason Crackjaw's not been found is the lack of leads. Look at the board. You haven't even said what he looks like.","nextNodeIds":[760440208]},{"nodeId":760440208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":2904600442,"text":"Well, if these treasure hunters set off without even knowing who they're looking for, well, they're hardly a match for someone like Hark. I don't want some novices wasting their time, much less throwing away their lives.","nextNodeIds":[760440209]},{"nodeId":760440209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1958800682,"text":"Fair point. Apart from the scar on his chin, what else can you tell me about him? Preferably something no one else knows?","nextNodeIds":[760440210]},{"nodeId":760440210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":2090341698,"text":"Something no one else knows... You're looking for physical characteristics? Like, say, if he had some marks on his back?","nextNodeIds":[760440211]},{"nodeId":760440211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2400527914,"text":"That's exactly what I'm looking for! But how do you know so much about him?","nextNodeIds":[760440212]},{"nodeId":760440212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":2688355562,"text":"I don't know squat. I never said he actually has any marks... Besides, even if he does, how are you going to see them?","nextNodeIds":[760440213]},{"nodeId":760440213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2303664234,"text":"W—Well, yeah, sorta... *sigh* So, there's nothing you can tell me? We've always worked well together — can't you give me anything to work with?","nextNodeIds":[760440214]},{"nodeId":760440214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":3057530402,"text":"After Hark revealed his true nature here in Nasha Town, he fled to the north of Lempo Isle and picked up his old life of crime.","nextNodeIds":[760440215]},{"nodeId":760440215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":333044626,"text":"That's old news. Everyone and their dog knows that.","nextNodeIds":[760440216]},{"nodeId":760440216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":702164834,"text":"No one's reported seeing him recently. What if he went further north? I could maybe track him to Piramida, but what if he's made it all the way to Snezhnograd?","nextNodeIds":[760440217]},{"nodeId":760440217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":404965434,"text":"(Nothing but ice and snow up there. I'm not sure if my arm would function in the cold...)","nextNodeIds":[760440218]},{"nodeId":760440218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":3430128266,"text":"He hasn't. He's still on Lempo Isle — I just don't know where. You can consider that \"something no one else knows.\"","nextNodeIds":[760440219]},{"nodeId":760440219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2180314754,"text":"Huh, how can you be so certain?","nextNodeIds":[760440220]},{"nodeId":760440220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":44541754,"text":"Now that's a trade secret — you wanna know, you'll have to pay.","nextNodeIds":[760440221]},{"nodeId":760440221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":4195163538,"text":"Hah, stingy! Still, a hulk of a man with a scar on his face... Even on Lempo Isle, they're not hard to find. How'm I supposed to know which one's Hark?","nextNodeIds":[760440222]},{"nodeId":760440222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":344242538,"text":"Well, seeing as how we \"work together so well,\" I'll give you some free advice. Don't get too caught up in looking for a scar.","nextNodeIds":[760440223]},{"nodeId":760440223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":94845850,"text":"...Are you saying, he's found some way to hide the scar on his chin?","nextNodeIds":[760440224]},{"nodeId":760440224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":269326914,"text":"I guess that makes sense. If everyone knows you as Crackjaw, walking around with no visible scar on your face would be a pretty good way to hide...","nextNodeIds":[760440225]},{"nodeId":760440225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1347381962,"text":"In that case, I just need to find someone who's deliberately hiding their jawline, right? It's a lead, at least... Alright, if I find anything new, I'll come back and fill you in.","nextNodeIds":[760440226]},{"nodeId":760440226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7012,"speakerName":"Leszek","textMapHash":2744374274,"text":"I'll wait with baited breath...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604402,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NON